      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but if people are worried about losing their autonomy or freedom of movement, isnt that a legitimate political concern even if they aren't believing a \"conspiracy\"? even if they are eventually going to be \"trapped\" or restricted by zoning laws, isn't it worth looking at why the policy feels threatening to them?",
